      <styleUrl>#phase1_style</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[
<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; width:300px; font-size:12px;">
  <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0; color:#1B365D;">San Juan</h3>
  <div style="color:#595959; margin-bottom:8px;">Baras, Rizal (Region IV-A (CALABARZON))</div>
  <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:11.5px;">
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Rollout Phase:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; color:#00B4D8; font-weight:bold;">Phase 1 (Rank #1)</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Population:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">4,838</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Households:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">1,169 (HH size 4.14)</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Subs @ 30%:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; font-weight:bold;">351</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Carrier:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Band n50 (1.5 GHz, 60 MHz)</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>n50 BTS Capacity:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; font-weight:bold; color:#166534;">1 BTS (@ 1k subs)</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Phase 1 Deployed:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; font-weight:bold; color:#1D4ED8;">1 BTS</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;"><b>Converge Backhaul:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;">Tier 1A (Active Node Hub, 3+ Nodes)</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:3px;"><b>Composite Score:</b></td><td style="padding:3px; font-weight:bold; color:#10B981;">98.95 / 100</td></tr>
  </table>
</div>
]]></description>
